1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nRea is disliked by her classmates due to her high grades. Last week, their class had a very challenging chemistry test. When the papers were graded and handed out, Rea realized that she was the only student who passed the test among her classmates. So, she immediately tore her test paper and threw it out before anyone else saw it.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Rea's Classmates ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Anger\nB) Surprise\nC) Disapproval\nD) Annoyance\nE) Nervousness\nF) Oblivious\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Rea's Classmates feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) They believe that everyone failed the test\nB) They think Rea also failed the test like them\nC) They don't know that Rea was the only one who passed the test\nD) They don't know how challenging the chemistry test was","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708475335369563,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88dd6006945d28099b8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369677053,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7aeecf2e0eaf4cb0b409fe91976db392"}